diff --git a/changelog.d/1380.change.md b/changelog.d/1380.change.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..ebcc425
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog.d/1380.change.md
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+`attrs.converters.pipe()` (and therefore composed converters passed as a list) only returns an `attrs.Converter` instance if at least one of the underlying converters is one.
